The 18 cm glyph is mapped to the horizontal paper in the Panda base frame.

4
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:10,000
A near-vertical brush pose is solved with the cached Panda URDF and joint limits.

5
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:33,000
The brush lifts between stroke groups. Pen-up travel adds no ink.

6
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:56,000
The brush shape is illustrative; exported ink footprints preserve the released renderer’s convention.

7
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:15,000
Scripted yi / legacy brush: a hand-authored path, separate from CalliRewrite prediction.

8
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:30,000
The completed Viser ink matches offline replay. Physical handwriting accuracy is not established.
